  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening South Sudan Women Leadership and Political Participation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the project is to strengthen the role of women leaders and women organizations to meaningfully contribute/participate in political and peacebuilding initiatives and processes that will lead to durable peace in South Sudan. It will enhance capacities and capabilities of women politicians, parliamentarians and heads of women&apos;s organizations to effectively influence decisions that affects women&apos;s and the community lives in South Sudan.</narrative>
  </description>
